cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "dwlsmv: DWLS/WLSMV estimation of SEM and CFA models with ordinal and binary indicators in Stata"
abstract: >-
  A Stata command fitting SEM/CFA models to ordinal and binary indicators by
  diagonally weighted least squares with the Muthén-style mean- and
  variance-adjusted (WLSMV) correction.
authors:
